**Overcharged boss dust** is a stronger variant with better effects. The first time you eat each overcharged variant, you gain **+1 permanent max heart** (up to 8 total, one per boss).

Overcharged dust is currently available in the **creative tab only**. Regular dust always drops from the corresponding Cataclysm boss.
